WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.168
-Hey, guys. It's Jimmy.

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:04.236
I'm here in beautiful
Puerto Rico at Toro Verde,

00:00:04.236 --> 00:00:07.140
and I'm about
to ride The Monster.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:10.676
It's one of the longest
zip lines in the world.

00:00:10.676 --> 00:00:12.278
Now, Tariq, you've done
zip lines before.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:13.779
Where have you zip lined before?

00:00:13.779 --> 00:00:15.582
-Fiji, Hawaii, New Jersey.

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:17.350
-Jersey?
-Yeah.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.519
-Quest, we asked you, would you
like to ride the zip line?

00:00:20.519 --> 00:00:21.854
And you responded with --

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:23.623
-Ah, heh, no.

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:25.925
-Guys, I am actually
scared of heights.

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:28.294
I don't know how
I'm going to do this.

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:30.696
I'm just gonna close my eyes
and go for it.

00:00:30.696 --> 00:00:33.099
Are you ready to do this, Tariq?
-I guess, yeah. Let's do it.

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:34.567
-Here we go.
[ Breathes sharply ]

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:37.203
♪♪

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:39.305
That's the zip line there.
You're our guides?

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:40.839
-Yeah, we're the guides.
-Hey. Jimmy.

00:00:40.839 --> 00:00:43.442
-Jimmy? Nice to meet you.
-Nice to meet you, too. Jimmy.

00:00:43.442 --> 00:00:44.911
-First we need to do
The Monster, buddy.

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:47.480
We're gonna do the second
longest in the world.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.382
First one in the Americas.
-Okay.

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:52.351
-We're talking about 2.3
kilometers to go down.

00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:55.388
400 meters up.
Have fun with it.

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:56.756
-We're gonna have fun with it.
-Have fun with it.

00:00:56.756 --> 00:00:58.157
-[ Laughs ]
-Jeez.

00:00:58.157 --> 00:01:00.860
-Let's go. Come on, Tar--
-Are you sure about this, guys?

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.528
-Wait, can I just --
I conquered The Monst--

00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:04.229
Can I just take a photo here
now and then...

00:01:04.229 --> 00:01:05.732
-Nah, nah, nah, you cheatin'.
-...act like I did it?

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:07.299
-That's cheating.
That's cheating.

00:01:07.299 --> 00:01:08.968
-That should be at the bottom.
-That's cheating. Come on.

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:10.803
-I just want to make sure
you're gonna do it.

00:01:10.803 --> 00:01:13.172
-Who's been doing -- who's been
working here the longest?

00:01:13.172 --> 00:01:16.475
-You want that answer?
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:16.475 --> 00:01:18.544
-Extra tight.
-Yeah, I gotta.

00:01:18.544 --> 00:01:21.814
I mean, dude, I got things
I gotta worry about in there.

00:01:21.814 --> 00:01:23.149
My phone and my wallet.

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:24.583
What were you thinking I was
talking about?

00:01:24.583 --> 00:01:26.219
A backpack?
-Yeah.

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:28.054
-Why would I be wearing
a backpack?

00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:29.656
-There's a parachute there.

00:01:29.656 --> 00:01:31.323
Something happens,
we need to make sure --

00:01:31.323 --> 00:01:32.792
-No, dude, absolutely not!

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:34.259
What is going on?
-Come on. Come on.

00:01:34.259 --> 00:01:35.728
-...the one you're gonna
use for --

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:38.364
-Your hair, man,
is going to get messed up.

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:40.566
-Fun.
This feels like fun.

00:01:40.566 --> 00:01:42.769
This is what people do
to have fun, I guess.

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:43.903
-You good?
-It's the silliest --

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:45.170
Yeah, no it feels good.
-Feels good?

00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:46.806
-My double chin is --

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:49.341
[ Deeper voice ]
It's altering my voice, but...

00:01:49.341 --> 00:01:50.910
Yeah,
I guess it's a little tight,

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.812
but I guess I'll just talk
like this for the rest of --

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:54.814
I sound like Shaggy.
♪ It wasn't me ♪

00:01:54.814 --> 00:01:56.482
♪ And then did it
on my counter ♪

00:01:56.482 --> 00:01:58.751
♪ It wasn't me ♪
-Say "Harry Potter."

00:01:58.751 --> 00:02:00.520
-Harry -- Harry Potter.

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:02.088
-Old San Juan is down there.

00:02:02.088 --> 00:02:04.424
That's the whole North Coast,
completely.

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:05.891
-Wow, it is --
-Really high up.

00:02:05.891 --> 00:02:07.359
-Just beautiful.
-Beautiful, man.

00:02:07.359 --> 00:02:10.597
-Yeah, I'm good here.
I mean, I can take this

00:02:10.597 --> 00:02:12.732
and go home and be psyched.

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:14.000
♪♪

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.401
-I'll try it later for you.

00:02:15.401 --> 00:02:16.802
-Nah.
-Stand up right here.

00:02:16.802 --> 00:02:20.206
-Why you shaking, buddy?
-[ Chuckles ]

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:21.907
-Can you hear that shaking?

00:02:21.907 --> 00:02:25.411
-If this bridge was so safe,
why would they need that?

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:27.480
♪♪

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.282
-Oh, my gosh.

00:02:29.282 --> 00:02:31.083
Oh, my gosh!

00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:32.886
Stop shaking the bridge!

00:02:32.886 --> 00:02:34.754
Tariq, it's not funny, dude.

00:02:34.754 --> 00:02:36.089
