00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:42.528
♪♪

00:02:42.528 --> 00:02:44.830
-[ Sighs ]

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:46.665
Whew...

00:02:46.665 --> 00:02:48.201
Oh...
-Are you ready to fly?

00:02:48.201 --> 00:02:51.204
-Ohh!
-And in this series finale

00:02:51.204 --> 00:02:53.539
