Jimmy Fallon" --

00:02:53.539 --> 00:02:55.308
-[ Exhales ]
-Hey, Jimmy...

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:56.609
-Yeah?

00:02:56.609 --> 00:02:58.177
-You have done zip line
before, right?

00:02:58.177 --> 00:03:01.347
-Never.
-Oh, my God.

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:03.582
